meta {
  name: List Aircraft Models
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/aircraft-models
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # List Aircraft Models (HU40 - Listar Tipos Aeronave)

  Lista todos los modelos de aeronave registrados.
  Este endpoint es público, no requiere autenticación.

  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "MOD_ACM_LIST_EXI_00001",
    "message": "...",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "encoded-id",
        "model_name": "Airbus A320neo",
        "aircraft_type_name": "Narrow Body",
        "engine_type_name": "Turbofan",
        "status": true,
        "_links": [...]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Errores
  - 500: Error interno (MOD_ACM_LIST_ERR_00001)
}
